			<Comment Bounds="285 590 970 45" Id="193" SizeToText="False" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>Note: Any programmatic updates to native NXG controls, such as the tab control, should be implemented in the main UI and not in a registered event.  This Callback generates a user event which is handled in the main UI event structure. Programmatic updates to controls within registered activeX events can cause lv NXG to hang.</p.Text>
